  "description": "Slack tap for Anbiq: receives requests from Slack threads and replies in them.",
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "Diyar Faraj",
  "homepage": "https://github.com/diyarfaraj/anbiq/tree/main/packages/tap-slack#readme",
